      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "SVGImage.SVG.SVGImage",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/SVGImage.SVG.SVGImage.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">This is the SVG image view control.\nThe image control can either load the image from a file <xref href=\"SVGImage.SVG.SVGImage.SetImage(System.String)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> or by\nsetting the <xref href=\"System.Windows.Media.Drawing\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> object through <xref href=\"SVGImage.SVG.SVGImage.SetImage(System.Windows.Media.Drawing)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, which allows\nmultiple controls to share the same drawing instance.</p>\n"
    },
